        "created_at": "2016-02-25T20:26:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I recall there being a file of 5-10 art images from Tactics which went around right after the Tactics Kickstarter.&nbsp; This was different from the ones which were posted in the updates during the campaign itself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Am I crazy?&nbsp; Is this still out there?&nbsp; I am modifying a few pieces (specifically, shots of Beacon, since I think she liiks better with pants), and that turns out a ton better with uploads than scanned cards.</p>",
